[90.95981, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m# 5. Summary\u001b[0m\r\n  - session 1 stated a fact and a preference; pan-memoryd curated the turn\r\n  - wiki page operations.staging-database (Markdown in git, with its source session) holds the fact\r\n  - USER.md holds the preference; Hermes puts USER.md / MEMORY.md into every new session\r\n  - session 2, a new session, was asked for the fact: PASS\r\n    (sources it had: MEMORY.md if the fact landed there, PAN's prefetch block, memory tools)\r\n  - everything lives in the scratch profile: DEMO_HOME=/tmp/pan-demo\r\n\r\nClean up with:  rm -rf \"/tmp/pan-demo\"\r\n"]
